@startuml
' 示例时序：发布活动 — 复制到 docs/epics/<epic>/tech/sequences/ 后改名改流程
title 示例：发布内容

actor Operator
participant "Console API" as API
participant "Application" as App
participant "Domain" as Dom
participant "MQ" as MQ
participant "Notification" as Comm

Operator -> API: POST /.../publish
API -> App: publish(uuid)
App -> Dom: 校验可发布 / 变更状态 PUBLISHED
Dom --> App: ok
App -> MQ: ContentPublished(uuid, ...)
App --> API: 200
MQ -> Comm: 创建/更新 subscription\n(subject, subjectId=uuid)

@enduml
